{
  "description": "Compare MTP schedules on the same GPU. The oracle uses the fastest K at each concurrency in the single-run sweep of K=1 through 7. The smooth schedule replaces non-monotonic choices with K=6 for batch sizes 1 through 4 and K=5 for larger batches.",
  "configurations": [
